<title>UK: TABLE - EASYNET H1 PRE-TAX LOSSES MUSHROOM.</title>
<headline>TABLE - EASYNET H1 PRE-TAX LOSSES MUSHROOM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		3.97 loss	    vs 1.86 loss</p>
<p> Pretax		     0.724 loss	   vs 0.244 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   2.48		   vs 0.62</p>
<p>NOTE - Easynet, a fast-growing UK internet service provider, said it expected to move towards profit in the fourth quarter of the year. Pre-tax losses have narrowed slightly from 0.727 million stg in the six months to December 31, 1996. Turnover in the same period of 1996 was 1.53 million stg and the loss per share 4.32p.</p>
<p>Full company name - Easynet Group Plc</p>
